                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00018         *
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00019         *   5      1988/02/22  Ron Lammardo
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00020         * Added code to display dp/u offsets; added code to display fcb bytes
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00021         * preceding eom; added code for z option (hex input disassembly);
