                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00032         *
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00033         *          2003/08/14  Rodney V. Hamilton
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00034         * Added code to output "end" line
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00035         *
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00036         *          2004/03/11  Rodney V. Hamilton
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00037         * Updated TFM register selection
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00038         *
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00039         *          2004/07/15  Robert Gault
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00040         * Added code to indicate manual start and end for disassembly.
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00041         *
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00042         *          2004/08/08  Robert Gault
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00043         * Changed getbyte routine to make "in memory" and disk i/o synchronize.
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00044         * This also required a slight change to gotmod. Added testing so that manual
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00045         * end/stop can't exceed module length. Almost have L lables working in Label
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00046         * field. If there should be lables and you don't see them, use the s option
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00047         * with s$0004$length_of_module. Then you should be able to use any values
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00048         * for start/stop and the L labels will still be present.
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00049         * Change in z option required by change in getbyte.
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00050         * S option uses fake data size. Added minor changes suggested by R.V.H.
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00051         *
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00052         *         2005/10/13  Robert Gault
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00053         * Forced to shrink labeltab size so that os9boot could be disassembled.
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00054         *   6     2019/07/25  L. Curtis Boyle
                      (1/cmds/disasm.asm):00055         * Fixed bug where PSHU/PULU would try and push/pull U onto itself. (chk.f7)
